{
  "id": "1SA.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "Samuel 1 10",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Koiili Samuel Saul koek laitoriat",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiinem anyun Samuel chuboitab mwaita, ak korong’ji metinnyi mwaita, ak kong’utut inendet, ak kolenji, Ma inye ne kagoiilin Jehovah iegu bounindet ne bo borotennyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye iwe rani eng’ yu ami, inyoru bik aeng’ eng’ ole bo kereritab Rael, eng’ kiwotetab Benjamin eng’ Selsa; ak komwaun bichoto kole, Kigenyor sigirocho kigewe icheng’ate: kogobagach kwandang’ung’ kabwatetab sigirok, ak kobwatak, kolen, Ayae nee agobo werinnyu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeityo iwe tai eng’ yoto kot iit ketitab Tabor, ak nyorun eng’ yoto bik somogu kotogosyin oldab Kamuktaindet eng’ Bet-el, kanabi age arek somok che bo ng’oror, koibei age makatinik somok, koibei age sotetab divaik:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak igatin, ak kogonin makatinik aeng’, che itaach eng’ eunywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye ibata iit tulwetab Kamuktaindet, ole mitei irimetab Pilistik: ak ye iit nganaset, ituiye maotik che kaiyumgei kochorugei eng’ ole toror kotinyei kibugandet, ak sugutit ne ming’in, ak ndurerut, ak ketubet eng’ tainywa; ak komaotenonu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak konyonjin Tamirmirietab Jehovah eng’ kimnatet, ak imaoten koboto ichek, ak kewalin iegu chito age. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye bwanjin kaborunoichu, iyai ko u ye kenyoru boroindo; amu mitei Kamuktaindet koboten. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeityo ichortege indoena iwe Gilgal; ak keero, achoruge ole imi, anyo agoite kagochinoik che kibeelei ak aeny tiseiywek che kagochinoikab kalyet: igenisie betusiek tisab, agoi aitu ole imi, ak aborun kit ne iyae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kingowelelgei kwo eng’ ole mi Samuel, kogochi Kamuktaindet inendet muguleldo age: ak kiisulda kaborunoichoto tugul eng’ betunoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingoit tulwet, ogeero, kotuiye inendet maotik che kigaiyumgei; ak kinyonji inendet Tamirmirietab Kamuktaindet eng’ kimnatet, ak kimaoten eng’ kwenunywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingogeer inendet bik tugul che kiingen inendet eng’ tai, komaoteni ak maotik, kolenjigei bik, Nee ni kogonyonji weritab Kis? Bo Saul agine maotik? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiwol age ne bo yoto, kole, Ak ko ng’o kwandanywa? Koek anyun kalewenet, kele, Bo Saul agine maotik? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingo kagoges maotenet, konyo ole toror.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiteebe imametab Saul ak otwogindennyi kolenji, Kigobe ano? Ak kile, Kiga kibe kecheng’ate sigirok: ak ye kingegeer kele mata kobiit, kebwa ole mi Samuel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile imametab Saul, Kaigai imwawa kit ne komwaun Samuel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Saul imamennyi, Kimwawech komie kole, kigenyor sigirok. Ago agobo ng’alekab laitornatet, che kimwachi Samuel, ko ma mwachi inendet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiguur Samuel bik koyumgei eng’ taitab Jehovah eng’ Mispa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kilenji lagokab Israel, Kamwa ko u ni Jehovah Kamuktaindetab Israel, kole, Kiamutu Israel kotogos eng’ Misri, ak kiasoruok eng’ eunekab Misrik, ak eng’ eunekab bororiosiek tugul che kiusok: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ago kaoesie ra Kamuktaindeng’wong’, ne inendet ne soruok eng’ bichiinwekwok ak nyalilwogikwok tugul; ak kaolenji inendet, Achicha, ago inde laitoriat koboiywech. Obwa anyun taitab Jehovah obwanune bororiosiekwok ak elfusiekwok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komut anyun Samuel bororiosiek tugul che bo Israel korik, ak kiginam bororietab Benjamin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeityo komut bororietab Benjamin korik kobwanune ortinwekwak, ak kiginam oretab Matirik: ak kiginam Saul weritab Kis; ago kigicheng’ inendet, ko ma kinyor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kota koteebe Jehovah anyun kogeny, kolenji, Ta komi chi ne ta konyonei yu? Ak kiwol Jehovah kole, Kaung’egei tuguk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiruai koba komut inendet eng’ oloto; ak kingotonon eng’ kwenutab bik, ko ki koi kosiir chi tugul kong’eete tigigoikyik ak kotogosta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Samwel bik tugul, Ogeer inendet ne kogolewen Jehovah, ole mami ne kergei ak inendet eng’ bik tugul? Ak kimwa bik tugul eng’ kutit ne o kole, Ingosob laitoriat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeityo komwachi Samuel bik kit ne u laitornatet, ak kisirji bukuit, ak kogonor eng’ taitab Jehovah. Ak kimwachi Samuel bik tugul koba, kwo chi tugul gonnyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiwa Saul agine gonnyi eng’ Gibea; ak kiba koboto inendet murenik che nyigonen, che kiga twa Kamuktaindet mugulelwekwak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kile werik alak che bo Belial, Sorundoech ano chichi? Ak kisas inendet, ama ipchi kagochinet. Ago kisis Saul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
